From: Abhilash <abhilash.koka1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:11:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add NMC / ICAI profession compliance to Brand Kit and
 generation

Brand Kit gains a Compliance profile: the regulated profession is
auto-detected from Business/Industry (doctor -> NMC, CA -> ICAI), confirmed
or overridden by the user, with verified practitioner facts and an extra
never-use list.

- Rule packs (lib/compliance/rulePacks.ts): per-rule prompt instruction,
  negative-list patterns, severity (block / review) and source citation.
- Rules are injected into caption/post/campaign prompts, video script
  writers, Guided Story screenplays and visual/B-roll prompts.
- Deterministic checker over narration, dialogue (incl. English meanings),
  titles and visual prompts; gates at enqueue (text/image-to-video prompt,
  dub script), Guided script approval, storyboard edit, storyboard approval
  (review findings need an acknowledgement recorded on the job) and render.
- Compliance snapshot frozen on each video job; regulated topic videos are
  forced into storyboard review; findings panel in storyboard review.
- API: /brand-kits/compliance/{rule-packs,detect,check}; VideoJob.compliance;
  approve accepts acknowledgeComplianceReview. Clients regenerated.

